{"key":"press-enter-ep04","seriesId":"press-enter","episode":"ep04","title":"Embeddings: How Numbers Get Meaning","fps":30,"duration":329.786,"durationInFrames":9894,"video":{"width":1920,"height":1080,"burnCaptions":true,"brand":"learnvi.in"},"badge":["STOP 04","VECTOR VALLEY"],"series":{"title":"What Happens When You Press Enter?","subtitle":"How ChatGPT, Claude and Gemini Really Work","runningPrompt":"Write a short poem about the rain","stops":[{"id":"ep01","number":1,"name":"Departure Gate","stamp":"DEPARTURE GATE","topic":"The whole journey"},{"id":"ep02","number":2,"name":"Library Town","stamp":"LIBRARY TOWN","topic":"Training"},{"id":"ep03","number":3,"name":"Token City","stamp":"TOKEN CITY","topic":"Tokenization"},{"id":"ep04","number":4,"name":"Vector Valley","stamp":"VECTOR VALLEY","topic":"Embeddings"},{"id":"ep05","number":5,"name":"Attention Junction","stamp":"ATTENTION JUNCTION","topic":"Attention"},{"id":"ep06","number":6,"name":"Prediction Station","stamp":"PREDICTION STATION","topic":"Next-token prediction"},{"id":"ep07","number":7,"name":"Arrivals Hall","stamp":"ARRIVALS HALL","topic":"Beyond the model"}]},"stop":{"number":4,"name":"Vector Valley","stamp":"VECTOR VALLEY"},"shorts":{"width":1080,"height":1920,"maxSeconds":60,"cta":"Full episode: What Happens When You Press Enter? · Stop 4"},"thumbnail":{"headline":"How AI knows rain is like storm","big":"king − man + woman"},"segments":[{"id":"passport","kind":"passport","component":"PassportStamp","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c01","start":0.6,"end":3.488,"marks":{"stamp":2.92},"text":"Next stop: Vector Valley! Passport out. Stamped.","words":[{"w":"Next","start":0.6},{"w":"stop:","start":0.92},{"w":"Vector","start":1.28},{"w":"Valley!","start":1.68},{"w":"Passport","start":2.08},{"w":"out.","start":2.64},{"w":"Stamped.","start":2.92}]},{"id":"c02","start":3.888,"end":11.93,"marks":{},"text":"This is stop number 4 of seven. At Token City, our prompt became a row of ID numbers. Today, those numbers get meaning.","words":[{"w":"This","start":3.888},{"w":"is","start":4.088},{"w":"stop","start":4.395},{"w":"number","start":4.701},{"w":"4","start":5.008},{"w":"of","start":5.288},{"w":"seven.","start":5.448},{"w":"At","start":6.048},{"w":"Token","start":6.288},{"w":"City,","start":6.768},{"w":"our","start":7.208},{"w":"prompt","start":7.408},{"w":"became","start":7.728},{"w":"a","start":8.048},{"w":"row","start":8.208},{"w":"of","start":8.448},{"w":"ID","start":8.915},{"w":"numbers.","start":9.381},{"w":"Today,","start":9.848},{"w":"those","start":10.315},{"w":"numbers","start":10.781},{"w":"get","start":11.248},{"w":"meaning.","start":11.488}]}],"title":"Next stop: Vector Valley","shortTitle":"Next stop: Vector Valley","props":{"stop":"Vector Valley","stamp":"VECTOR VALLEY","number":"4","stampAt":"c01@stamp"},"start":0.6,"end":11.93,"startFrame":0,"durationInFrames":385},{"id":"hook","kind":"hook","component":"BigIdea","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c03","start":12.833,"end":18.62,"marks":{},"text":"Here's a famous result. Take the word king, subtract man, add woman, and you land on queen.","words":[{"w":"Here's","start":12.833},{"w":"a","start":13.153},{"w":"famous","start":13.313},{"w":"result.","start":13.753},{"w":"Take","start":14.393},{"w":"the","start":14.673},{"w":"word","start":14.833},{"w":"king,","start":15.153},{"w":"subtract","start":15.633},{"w":"man,","start":16.353},{"w":"add","start":16.673},{"w":"woman,","start":17.033},{"w":"and","start":17.353},{"w":"you","start":17.513},{"w":"land","start":17.713},{"w":"on","start":18.015},{"w":"queen.","start":18.318}]},{"id":"c04","start":19.02,"end":23.148,"marks":{},"text":"That only works because meaning can live inside numbers. Let's see how.","words":[{"w":"That","start":19.02},{"w":"only","start":19.22},{"w":"works","start":19.5},{"w":"because","start":19.86},{"w":"meaning","start":20.14},{"w":"can","start":20.54},{"w":"live","start":20.7},{"w":"inside","start":21.167},{"w":"numbers.","start":21.633},{"w":"Let's","start":22.1},{"w":"see","start":22.5},{"w":"how.","start":22.78}]}],"title":"King minus man plus woman","shortTitle":"King minus man plus woman","props":{"kicker":"Episode 4","text":"King − man + woman = queen. Meaning can live inside numbers.","highlight":["queen.","numbers."]},"start":12.833,"end":23.148,"startFrame":385,"durationInFrames":337},{"id":"route","kind":"routeMap","component":"RouteMap","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c05","start":24.067,"end":30.96,"marks":{"here":27.267},"text":"On the route map, we've passed through Token City, and we're here, in Vector Valley, where words get a place on a map of meaning.","words":[{"w":"On","start":24.067},{"w":"the","start":24.187},{"w":"route","start":24.347},{"w":"map,","start":24.667},{"w":"we've","start":25.027},{"w":"passed","start":25.347},{"w":"through","start":25.667},{"w":"Token","start":25.947},{"w":"City,","start":26.467},{"w":"and","start":26.827},{"w":"we're","start":27.027},{"w":"here,","start":27.267},{"w":"in","start":27.6},{"w":"Vector","start":27.934},{"w":"Valley,","start":28.267},{"w":"where","start":28.747},{"w":"words","start":28.987},{"w":"get","start":29.347},{"w":"a","start":29.547},{"w":"place","start":29.667},{"w":"on","start":29.907},{"w":"a","start":30.067},{"w":"map","start":30.147},{"w":"of","start":30.387},{"w":"meaning.","start":30.547}]}],"title":"Route map","shortTitle":"Route map","props":{"current":"ep04","highlightAt":"c05@here"},"start":24.067,"end":30.96,"startFrame":722,"durationInFrames":234},{"id":"idtovec","kind":"core","component":"Steps","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c06","start":31.867,"end":36.428,"marks":{},"text":"First, a quick bridge from our last stop. Here's how a token becomes a vector.","words":[{"w":"First,","start":31.867},{"w":"a","start":32.047},{"w":"quick","start":32.227},{"w":"bridge","start":32.787},{"w":"from","start":33.187},{"w":"our","start":33.347},{"w":"last","start":33.547},{"w":"stop.","start":33.827},{"w":"Here's","start":34.287},{"w":"how","start":34.747},{"w":"a","start":34.907},{"w":"token","start":35.027},{"w":"becomes","start":35.467},{"w":"a","start":35.647},{"w":"vector.","start":35.827}]},{"id":"c07","start":36.828,"end":40.837,"marks":{},"text":"We start with a token, like the word rain, with its little space in front.","words":[{"w":"We","start":36.828},{"w":"start","start":36.988},{"w":"with","start":37.268},{"w":"a","start":37.388},{"w":"token,","start":37.508},{"w":"like","start":38.068},{"w":"the","start":38.268},{"w":"word","start":38.428},{"w":"rain,","start":38.748},{"w":"with","start":39.188},{"w":"its","start":39.388},{"w":"little","start":39.588},{"w":"space","start":39.828},{"w":"in","start":40.188},{"w":"front.","start":40.428}]},{"id":"c08","start":41.237,"end":49.345,"marks":{},"text":"The tokenizer turned it into an ID, a number like 4,812. On its own, that number says nothing about weather.","words":[{"w":"The","start":41.237},{"w":"tokenizer","start":41.357},{"w":"turned","start":42.117},{"w":"it","start":42.437},{"w":"into","start":42.597},{"w":"an","start":42.797},{"w":"ID,","start":43.024},{"w":"a","start":43.25},{"w":"number","start":43.477},{"w":"like","start":44.037},{"w":"4,812.","start":44.277},{"w":"On","start":46.437},{"w":"its","start":46.717},{"w":"own,","start":47.037},{"w":"that","start":47.384},{"w":"number","start":47.73},{"w":"says","start":48.077},{"w":"nothing","start":48.357},{"w":"about","start":48.677},{"w":"weather.","start":48.917}]},{"id":"c09","start":49.745,"end":56.399,"marks":{},"text":"So the model looks up row 4,812 of a giant table, one row for every token it knows.","words":[{"w":"So","start":49.745},{"w":"the","start":49.905},{"w":"model","start":50.025},{"w":"looks","start":50.425},{"w":"up","start":50.665},{"w":"row","start":50.905},{"w":"4,812","start":51.145},{"w":"of","start":52.785},{"w":"a","start":52.945},{"w":"giant","start":53.105},{"w":"table,","start":53.545},{"w":"one","start":54.185},{"w":"row","start":54.545},{"w":"for","start":54.905},{"w":"every","start":55.105},{"w":"token","start":55.345},{"w":"it","start":55.825},{"w":"knows.","start":56.025}]},{"id":"c10","start":56.799,"end":63.778,"marks":{},"text":"And that row is the token's vector: a list of hundreds, or even thousands, of numbers. This is called an embedding.","words":[{"w":"And","start":56.799},{"w":"that","start":56.959},{"w":"row","start":57.199},{"w":"is","start":57.479},{"w":"the","start":57.639},{"w":"token's","start":58.052},{"w":"vector:","start":58.466},{"w":"a","start":58.879},{"w":"list","start":59.079},{"w":"of","start":59.359},{"w":"hundreds,","start":59.519},{"w":"or","start":60.079},{"w":"even","start":60.359},{"w":"thousands,","start":60.639},{"w":"of","start":61.146},{"w":"numbers.","start":61.652},{"w":"This","start":62.159},{"w":"is","start":62.439},{"w":"called","start":62.639},{"w":"an","start":62.999},{"w":"embedding.","start":63.159}]}],"title":"From ID to vector","shortTitle":"From ID to vector","props":{"kicker":"From Token City","title":"From a token ID to a vector","steps":[{"label":"Token","detail":"“ rain”"},{"label":"ID","detail":"a number, like 4,812"},{"label":"Look up","detail":"row 4,812 of a giant table"},{"label":"Vector","detail":"hundreds of numbers"}]},"start":31.867,"end":63.778,"startFrame":956,"durationInFrames":985},{"id":"map","kind":"core","component":"MeaningMap","short":true,"cues":[{"id":"c11","start":64.7,"end":72.859,"marks":{},"text":"Those numbers are easiest to understand as a position on a map. Real maps have hundreds of directions, but let's squash it down to two.","words":[{"w":"Those","start":64.94},{"w":"numbers","start":65.18},{"w":"are","start":65.42},{"w":"easiest","start":65.62},{"w":"to","start":66.1},{"w":"understand","start":66.3},{"w":"as","start":66.86},{"w":"a","start":67.02},{"w":"position","start":67.18},{"w":"on","start":67.66},{"w":"a","start":67.78},{"w":"map.","start":67.94},{"w":"Real","start":68.54},{"w":"maps","start":69.02},{"w":"have","start":69.5},{"w":"hundreds","start":69.74},{"w":"of","start":70.1},{"w":"directions,","start":70.26},{"w":"but","start":71.02},{"w":"let's","start":71.24},{"w":"squash","start":71.46},{"w":"it","start":71.94},{"w":"down","start":72.14},{"w":"to","start":72.34},{"w":"two.","start":72.5}]},{"id":"c12","start":73.259,"end":77.097,"marks":{},"text":"In one corner, the animals: cat, dog and horse, close together.","words":[{"w":"In","start":73.259},{"w":"one","start":73.419},{"w":"corner,","start":73.579},{"w":"the","start":74.019},{"w":"animals:","start":74.219},{"w":"cat,","start":74.939},{"w":"dog","start":75.379},{"w":"and","start":75.739},{"w":"horse,","start":75.939},{"w":"close","start":76.259},{"w":"together.","start":76.619}]},{"id":"c13","start":77.497,"end":80.637,"marks":{},"text":"In another corner, the weather: rain, storm and cloud.","words":[{"w":"In","start":77.497},{"w":"another","start":77.617},{"w":"corner,","start":77.897},{"w":"the","start":78.417},{"w":"weather:","start":78.577},{"w":"rain,","start":79.017},{"w":"storm","start":79.497},{"w":"and","start":79.977},{"w":"cloud.","start":80.177}]},{"id":"c14","start":81.037,"end":84.373,"marks":{},"text":"And down at the bottom, food: banana, apple and bread.","words":[{"w":"And","start":81.037},{"w":"down","start":81.197},{"w":"at","start":81.397},{"w":"the","start":81.557},{"w":"bottom,","start":81.677},{"w":"food:","start":82.157},{"w":"banana,","start":82.717},{"w":"apple","start":83.357},{"w":"and","start":83.757},{"w":"bread.","start":83.957}]},{"id":"c15","start":84.773,"end":89.042,"marks":{},"text":"Rain and storm sit very close together, because their meanings are similar.","words":[{"w":"Rain","start":84.773},{"w":"and","start":85.133},{"w":"storm","start":85.333},{"w":"sit","start":85.773},{"w":"very","start":86.093},{"w":"close","start":86.373},{"w":"together,","start":86.733},{"w":"because","start":87.293},{"w":"their","start":87.573},{"w":"meanings","start":87.813},{"w":"are","start":88.333},{"w":"similar.","start":88.533}]},{"id":"c16","start":89.442,"end":93.365,"marks":{},"text":"Rain and banana are far apart. They have almost nothing in common.","words":[{"w":"Rain","start":89.442},{"w":"and","start":89.762},{"w":"banana","start":89.922},{"w":"are","start":90.442},{"w":"far","start":90.642},{"w":"apart.","start":90.882},{"w":"They","start":91.482},{"w":"have","start":91.682},{"w":"almost","start":91.962},{"w":"nothing","start":92.322},{"w":"in","start":92.642},{"w":"common.","start":92.882}]}],"title":"A map of meaning","shortTitle":"How AI puts words on a map of meaning","props":{"kicker":"Meaning space","title":"Imagine every word on a map","groups":[{"label":"Animals","at":"c12","points":[{"word":"cat","x":10,"y":30},{"word":"dog","x":24,"y":18},{"word":"horse","x":18,"y":46}]},{"label":"Weather","at":"c13","points":[{"word":"rain","x":68,"y":34},{"word":"storm","x":88,"y":16},{"word":"cloud","x":84,"y":50}]},{"label":"Food","at":"c14","points":[{"word":"banana","x":38,"y":84},{"word":"apple","x":52,"y":92},{"word":"bread","x":60,"y":76}]}],"links":[{"from":"rain","to":"storm","label":"close","at":"c15"},{"from":"rain","to":"banana","label":"far","good":false,"at":"c16"}]},"start":64.7,"end":93.365,"startFrame":1941,"durationInFrames":887},{"id":"similar","kind":"core","component":"Definition","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c17","start":94.267,"end":105.568,"marks":{},"text":"To measure how close two words are, the model compares their vectors, usually by the angle between them. This is called cosine similarity, and you don't need the formula to get the idea.","words":[{"w":"To","start":94.267},{"w":"measure","start":94.427},{"w":"how","start":94.827},{"w":"close","start":95.067},{"w":"two","start":95.427},{"w":"words","start":95.667},{"w":"are,","start":96.027},{"w":"the","start":96.347},{"w":"model","start":96.507},{"w":"compares","start":96.987},{"w":"their","start":97.467},{"w":"vectors,","start":97.947},{"w":"usually","start":98.427},{"w":"by","start":99.027},{"w":"the","start":99.187},{"w":"angle","start":99.347},{"w":"between","start":99.867},{"w":"them.","start":100.267},{"w":"This","start":100.787},{"w":"is","start":101.107},{"w":"called","start":101.387},{"w":"cosine","start":101.867},{"w":"similarity,","start":102.347},{"w":"and","start":103.187},{"w":"you","start":103.347},{"w":"don't","start":103.547},{"w":"need","start":103.747},{"w":"the","start":103.987},{"w":"formula","start":104.107},{"w":"to","start":104.587},{"w":"get","start":104.707},{"w":"the","start":104.907},{"w":"idea.","start":105.067}]},{"id":"c18","start":105.968,"end":109.239,"marks":{},"text":"Rain and storm score high. Rain and banana score low.","words":[{"w":"Rain","start":105.968},{"w":"and","start":106.288},{"w":"storm","start":106.448},{"w":"score","start":106.808},{"w":"high.","start":107.208},{"w":"Rain","start":107.568},{"w":"and","start":107.888},{"w":"banana","start":108.048},{"w":"score","start":108.528},{"w":"low.","start":108.888}]},{"id":"c19","start":109.639,"end":117.782,"marks":{},"text":"Picture each vector as an arrow. Similar words point in almost the same direction; unrelated words point very different ways.","words":[{"w":"Picture","start":109.639},{"w":"each","start":110.119},{"w":"vector","start":110.439},{"w":"as","start":110.919},{"w":"an","start":111.119},{"w":"arrow.","start":111.319},{"w":"Similar","start":111.919},{"w":"words","start":112.639},{"w":"point","start":113.039},{"w":"in","start":113.279},{"w":"almost","start":113.519},{"w":"the","start":113.879},{"w":"same","start":113.999},{"w":"direction;","start":114.319},{"w":"unrelated","start":115.079},{"w":"words","start":115.879},{"w":"point","start":116.319},{"w":"very","start":116.639},{"w":"different","start":116.919},{"w":"ways.","start":117.359}]}],"title":"Measuring closeness","shortTitle":"Measuring closeness","props":{"kicker":"Similarity","term":"Similarity","definition":"How close two word vectors are, usually measured by the angle between them. This is called cosine similarity.","example":"rain · storm: high   rain · banana: low","analogy":"Two arrows pointing almost the same way, or in very different directions."},"start":94.267,"end":117.782,"startFrame":2828,"durationInFrames":733},{"id":"learned","kind":"core","component":"Bullets","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c20","start":118.7,"end":122.454,"marks":{},"text":"Here's the remarkable part: nobody draws this map by hand.","words":[{"w":"Here's","start":118.7},{"w":"the","start":119.06},{"w":"remarkable","start":119.22},{"w":"part:","start":119.94},{"w":"nobody","start":120.3},{"w":"draws","start":120.94},{"w":"this","start":121.3},{"w":"map","start":121.54},{"w":"by","start":121.86},{"w":"hand.","start":122.06}]},{"id":"c21","start":122.854,"end":129.006,"marks":{},"text":"During training, words used in similar sentences get nudged a little closer together, over and over.","words":[{"w":"During","start":122.854},{"w":"training,","start":123.214},{"w":"words","start":123.894},{"w":"used","start":124.334},{"w":"in","start":124.654},{"w":"similar","start":124.814},{"w":"sentences","start":125.254},{"w":"get","start":125.721},{"w":"nudged","start":126.187},{"w":"a","start":126.654},{"w":"little","start":126.774},{"w":"closer","start":126.974},{"w":"together,","start":127.374},{"w":"over","start":128.014},{"w":"and","start":128.334},{"w":"over.","start":128.574}]},{"id":"c22","start":129.406,"end":135.21,"marks":{},"text":"Rain and storm keep the same company: wet, cloud, umbrella, forecast. So they drift together.","words":[{"w":"Rain","start":129.406},{"w":"and","start":129.726},{"w":"storm","start":129.886},{"w":"keep","start":130.286},{"w":"the","start":130.486},{"w":"same","start":130.646},{"w":"company:","start":130.926},{"w":"wet,","start":131.526},{"w":"cloud,","start":132.046},{"w":"umbrella,","start":132.566},{"w":"forecast.","start":133.086},{"w":"So","start":133.886},{"w":"they","start":134.126},{"w":"drift","start":134.366},{"w":"together.","start":134.726}]},{"id":"c23","start":135.61,"end":140.565,"marks":{},"text":"After billions of examples, the map organises itself, with no labels at all.","words":[{"w":"After","start":135.61},{"w":"billions","start":135.93},{"w":"of","start":136.45},{"w":"examples,","start":136.57},{"w":"the","start":137.25},{"w":"map","start":137.45},{"w":"organises","start":137.81},{"w":"itself,","start":138.57},{"w":"with","start":139.17},{"w":"no","start":139.37},{"w":"labels","start":139.61},{"w":"at","start":140.17},{"w":"all.","start":140.33}]}],"title":"How the map is learned","shortTitle":"How the map is learned","props":{"kicker":"Learned, not written","title":"Nobody draws this map by hand","items":[{"text":"Words used in similar sentences get nudged closer"},{"text":"“rain” and “storm” share neighbours: wet, cloud, umbrella"},{"text":"After billions of examples, the map organises itself"}],"numbered":false},"start":118.7,"end":140.565,"startFrame":3561,"durationInFrames":683},{"id":"maths","kind":"core","component":"Bullets","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c24","start":141.467,"end":147.657,"marks":{},"text":"And because the map is so well organised, directions on it carry meaning. That's where word maths comes from.","words":[{"w":"And","start":141.467},{"w":"because","start":141.587},{"w":"the","start":141.827},{"w":"map","start":141.987},{"w":"is","start":142.307},{"w":"so","start":142.507},{"w":"well","start":142.747},{"w":"organised,","start":142.987},{"w":"directions","start":143.787},{"w":"on","start":144.467},{"w":"it","start":144.587},{"w":"carry","start":144.787},{"w":"meaning.","start":145.107},{"w":"That's","start":145.667},{"w":"where","start":146.107},{"w":"word","start":146.347},{"w":"maths","start":146.707},{"w":"comes","start":147.067},{"w":"from.","start":147.427}]},{"id":"c25","start":148.057,"end":151.924,"marks":{},"text":"From king, take away man, add woman, and the nearest word is queen.","words":[{"w":"From","start":148.057},{"w":"king,","start":148.297},{"w":"take","start":148.657},{"w":"away","start":148.937},{"w":"man,","start":149.257},{"w":"add","start":149.657},{"w":"woman,","start":150.057},{"w":"and","start":150.377},{"w":"the","start":150.537},{"w":"nearest","start":150.657},{"w":"word","start":151.097},{"w":"is","start":151.373},{"w":"queen.","start":151.648}]},{"id":"c26","start":152.324,"end":160.818,"marks":{},"text":"From Paris, take away France, add Italy, and you land near Rome. The direction from a country to its capital is roughly the same everywhere.","words":[{"w":"From","start":152.324},{"w":"Paris,","start":152.564},{"w":"take","start":153.044},{"w":"away","start":153.324},{"w":"France,","start":153.604},{"w":"add","start":154.164},{"w":"Italy,","start":154.484},{"w":"and","start":155.044},{"w":"you","start":155.244},{"w":"land","start":155.444},{"w":"near","start":155.764},{"w":"Rome.","start":156.084},{"w":"The","start":156.644},{"w":"direction","start":156.964},{"w":"from","start":157.524},{"w":"a","start":157.684},{"w":"country","start":157.804},{"w":"to","start":158.164},{"w":"its","start":158.324},{"w":"capital","start":158.564},{"w":"is","start":159.084},{"w":"roughly","start":159.284},{"w":"the","start":159.724},{"w":"same","start":159.884},{"w":"everywhere.","start":160.244}]}],"title":"Word maths","shortTitle":"Word maths","props":{"kicker":"Word maths","title":"Directions on the map carry meaning","items":[{"text":"king − man + woman ≈ queen"},{"text":"Paris − France + Italy ≈ Rome"}],"numbered":false},"start":141.467,"end":160.818,"startFrame":4244,"durationInFrames":608},{"id":"position","kind":"core","component":"Definition","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c27","start":161.733,"end":174.397,"marks":{},"text":"There's one more thing the model needs. A word's vector says what it means, but not where it is. So each token also gets position information, extra numbers mixed in that say where it sits in the sentence.","words":[{"w":"There's","start":161.733},{"w":"one","start":162.053},{"w":"more","start":162.253},{"w":"thing","start":162.533},{"w":"the","start":162.813},{"w":"model","start":162.933},{"w":"needs.","start":163.413},{"w":"A","start":164.053},{"w":"word's","start":164.413},{"w":"vector","start":164.773},{"w":"says","start":165.133},{"w":"what","start":165.413},{"w":"it","start":165.573},{"w":"means,","start":165.733},{"w":"but","start":166.213},{"w":"not","start":166.453},{"w":"where","start":166.733},{"w":"it","start":166.973},{"w":"is.","start":167.213},{"w":"So","start":167.653},{"w":"each","start":167.973},{"w":"token","start":168.333},{"w":"also","start":168.933},{"w":"gets","start":169.253},{"w":"position","start":169.573},{"w":"information,","start":170.053},{"w":"extra","start":170.666},{"w":"numbers","start":171.28},{"w":"mixed","start":171.893},{"w":"in","start":172.213},{"w":"that","start":172.373},{"w":"say","start":172.573},{"w":"where","start":172.813},{"w":"it","start":173.013},{"w":"sits","start":173.173},{"w":"in","start":173.533},{"w":"the","start":173.653},{"w":"sentence.","start":173.773}]},{"id":"c28","start":174.797,"end":181.599,"marks":{},"text":"Without it, \"dog bites man\" and \"man bites dog\" would look exactly the same. Same words, very different news.","words":[{"w":"Without","start":174.797},{"w":"it,","start":175.157},{"w":"\"dog","start":175.437},{"w":"bites","start":175.757},{"w":"man\"","start":176.237},{"w":"and","start":176.477},{"w":"\"man","start":176.677},{"w":"bites","start":176.877},{"w":"dog\"","start":177.317},{"w":"would","start":177.677},{"w":"look","start":177.837},{"w":"exactly","start":178.037},{"w":"the","start":178.637},{"w":"same.","start":178.797},{"w":"Same","start":179.477},{"w":"words,","start":179.917},{"w":"very","start":180.397},{"w":"different","start":180.717},{"w":"news.","start":181.197}]},{"id":"c29","start":181.999,"end":187.151,"marks":{},"text":"Think of seat numbers on a train ticket. Same passengers, different seats, a different trip.","words":[{"w":"Think","start":181.999},{"w":"of","start":182.159},{"w":"seat","start":182.439},{"w":"numbers","start":182.719},{"w":"on","start":182.999},{"w":"a","start":183.159},{"w":"train","start":183.319},{"w":"ticket.","start":183.599},{"w":"Same","start":184.279},{"w":"passengers,","start":184.719},{"w":"different","start":185.479},{"w":"seats,","start":185.879},{"w":"a","start":186.279},{"w":"different","start":186.439},{"w":"trip.","start":186.799}]}],"title":"Knowing word order","shortTitle":"Knowing word order","props":{"kicker":"Word order","term":"Position","definition":"Extra numbers mixed into each token's vector, saying where it sits in the sentence.","example":"“dog bites man” ≠ “man bites dog”","analogy":"Seat numbers on a train ticket: same passengers, different seats, different trip."},"start":161.733,"end":187.151,"startFrame":4852,"durationInFrames":790},{"id":"search","kind":"core","component":"Compare","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c30","start":188.067,"end":191.158,"marks":{},"text":"You'll meet embeddings outside chatbots too, in search.","words":[{"w":"You'll","start":188.067},{"w":"meet","start":188.227},{"w":"embeddings","start":188.547},{"w":"outside","start":188.987},{"w":"chatbots","start":189.527},{"w":"too,","start":190.067},{"w":"in","start":190.427},{"w":"search.","start":190.627}]},{"id":"c31","start":191.558,"end":198.344,"marks":{},"text":"Keyword search finds the exact words you typed. Search for \"car\", and you'll miss a note that only says \"vehicle\".","words":[{"w":"Keyword","start":191.558},{"w":"search","start":192.038},{"w":"finds","start":192.398},{"w":"the","start":192.758},{"w":"exact","start":192.918},{"w":"words","start":193.398},{"w":"you","start":193.718},{"w":"typed.","start":193.878},{"w":"Search","start":194.518},{"w":"for","start":195.038},{"w":"\"car\",","start":195.278},{"w":"and","start":195.638},{"w":"you'll","start":195.878},{"w":"miss","start":196.158},{"w":"a","start":196.398},{"w":"note","start":196.518},{"w":"that","start":196.798},{"w":"only","start":196.998},{"w":"says","start":197.447},{"w":"\"vehicle\".","start":197.895}]},{"id":"c32","start":198.744,"end":209.065,"marks":{},"text":"Meaning search compares embeddings instead, so \"car\" also finds \"vehicle\" and \"sedan\". This is the same trick behind RAG, which we'll meet at our final stop.","words":[{"w":"Meaning","start":198.744},{"w":"search","start":199.144},{"w":"compares","start":199.504},{"w":"embeddings","start":200.024},{"w":"instead,","start":200.584},{"w":"so","start":201.224},{"w":"\"car\"","start":201.584},{"w":"also","start":201.944},{"w":"finds","start":202.491},{"w":"\"vehicle\"","start":203.037},{"w":"and","start":203.584},{"w":"\"sedan\".","start":203.864},{"w":"This","start":204.664},{"w":"is","start":205.064},{"w":"the","start":205.224},{"w":"same","start":205.464},{"w":"trick","start":205.784},{"w":"behind","start":206.224},{"w":"RAG,","start":206.664},{"w":"which","start":207.144},{"w":"we'll","start":207.344},{"w":"meet","start":207.544},{"w":"at","start":207.824},{"w":"our","start":207.984},{"w":"final","start":208.184},{"w":"stop.","start":208.624}]}],"title":"Search by meaning","shortTitle":"Search by meaning","props":{"kicker":"Where else you'll meet them","title":"Keyword search versus meaning search","columns":[{"title":"Keyword search","items":["finds the exact words","“car” misses “vehicle”"],"tone":"neutral"},{"title":"Meaning search","items":["finds similar meanings","“car” finds “vehicle”, “sedan”"],"tone":"good"}],"verdict":{"text":"Embeddings power meaning search, and RAG at our final stop"}},"start":188.067,"end":209.065,"startFrame":5642,"durationInFrames":657},{"id":"tryIt","kind":"tryIt","component":"TryIt","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c33","start":209.967,"end":212.755,"marks":{},"text":"Time for \"Try it yourself\": a word-maths game.","words":[{"w":"Time","start":209.967},{"w":"for","start":210.287},{"w":"\"Try","start":210.447},{"w":"it","start":210.727},{"w":"yourself\":","start":210.887},{"w":"a","start":211.447},{"w":"word-maths","start":211.907},{"w":"game.","start":212.367}]},{"id":"c34","start":213.155,"end":218.79,"marks":{},"text":"First, make your own guess. Which is closest in meaning to rain: umbrella, storm, or Tuesday?","words":[{"w":"First,","start":213.155},{"w":"make","start":213.475},{"w":"your","start":213.675},{"w":"own","start":213.835},{"w":"guess.","start":214.035},{"w":"Which","start":214.595},{"w":"is","start":214.835},{"w":"closest","start":215.035},{"w":"in","start":215.515},{"w":"meaning","start":215.675},{"w":"to","start":215.995},{"w":"rain:","start":216.488},{"w":"umbrella,","start":216.982},{"w":"storm,","start":217.475},{"w":"or","start":217.955},{"w":"Tuesday?","start":218.155}]},{"id":"c35","start":219.19,"end":226.961,"marks":{},"text":"Then ask a chatbot to rank them, and to explain why. See if it agrees with you, and whether it puts umbrella closer than you expected.","words":[{"w":"Then","start":219.19},{"w":"ask","start":219.35},{"w":"a","start":219.63},{"w":"chatbot","start":219.97},{"w":"to","start":220.31},{"w":"rank","start":220.43},{"w":"them,","start":220.79},{"w":"and","start":221.07},{"w":"to","start":221.27},{"w":"explain","start":221.47},{"w":"why.","start":222.11},{"w":"See","start":222.67},{"w":"if","start":222.95},{"w":"it","start":223.19},{"w":"agrees","start":223.35},{"w":"with","start":223.83},{"w":"you,","start":223.99},{"w":"and","start":224.19},{"w":"whether","start":224.39},{"w":"it","start":224.67},{"w":"puts","start":224.977},{"w":"umbrella","start":225.283},{"w":"closer","start":225.59},{"w":"than","start":225.99},{"w":"you","start":226.15},{"w":"expected.","start":226.39}]}],"title":"Try it yourself","shortTitle":"Try it yourself","props":{"steps":[{"text":"Guess: which is closest in meaning to “rain”: umbrella, storm or Tuesday?","at":"c34"},{"text":"Ask a chatbot to rank them, and to explain why.","at":"c35"}],"chat":"Rank by closeness to “rain”: umbrella, storm, Tuesday"},"start":209.967,"end":236.961,"startFrame":6299,"durationInFrames":837},{"id":"blooper","kind":"blooper","component":"Blooper","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c36","start":237.867,"end":241.246,"marks":{},"text":"AI blooper time. But this one is a serious lesson.","words":[{"w":"AI","start":238.207},{"w":"blooper","start":238.547},{"w":"time.","start":238.887},{"w":"But","start":239.227},{"w":"this","start":239.467},{"w":"one","start":239.747},{"w":"is","start":239.947},{"w":"a","start":240.107},{"w":"serious","start":240.487},{"w":"lesson.","start":240.866}]},{"id":"c37","start":241.646,"end":251.676,"marks":{},"text":"In 2016, researchers tried word maths on vectors trained on news articles. They asked: man is to computer programmer, as woman is to what?","words":[{"w":"In","start":241.646},{"w":"2016,","start":241.806},{"w":"researchers","start":243.166},{"w":"tried","start":243.886},{"w":"word","start":244.246},{"w":"maths","start":244.526},{"w":"on","start":244.899},{"w":"vectors","start":245.273},{"w":"trained","start":245.646},{"w":"on","start":246.006},{"w":"news","start":246.206},{"w":"articles.","start":246.486},{"w":"They","start":247.326},{"w":"asked:","start":247.726},{"w":"man","start":248.366},{"w":"is","start":248.766},{"w":"to","start":248.966},{"w":"computer","start":249.166},{"w":"programmer,","start":249.646},{"w":"as","start":250.366},{"w":"woman","start":250.566},{"w":"is","start":250.926},{"w":"to","start":251.126},{"w":"what?","start":251.326}]},{"id":"c38","start":252.076,"end":269.158,"marks":{"reply":253.696},"text":"And the vectors answered: homemaker. The maths worked perfectly. The problem was the text: the vectors had faithfully learned the stereotypes in what they read. Modern models are trained and tested to reduce this, but it's a reminder that a model can only be as fair as its data.","words":[{"w":"And","start":252.076},{"w":"the","start":252.356},{"w":"vectors","start":252.636},{"w":"answered:","start":252.916},{"w":"homemaker.","start":253.696},{"w":"The","start":254.476},{"w":"maths","start":254.796},{"w":"worked","start":255.276},{"w":"perfectly.","start":255.676},{"w":"The","start":256.556},{"w":"problem","start":256.796},{"w":"was","start":257.356},{"w":"the","start":257.476},{"w":"text:","start":257.676},{"w":"the","start":258.103},{"w":"vectors","start":258.529},{"w":"had","start":258.956},{"w":"faithfully","start":259.116},{"w":"learned","start":259.676},{"w":"the","start":259.956},{"w":"stereotypes","start":260.076},{"w":"in","start":260.996},{"w":"what","start":261.196},{"w":"they","start":261.396},{"w":"read.","start":261.636},{"w":"Modern","start":262.196},{"w":"models","start":262.796},{"w":"are","start":263.276},{"w":"trained","start":263.436},{"w":"and","start":263.876},{"w":"tested","start":264.076},{"w":"to","start":264.516},{"w":"reduce","start":264.676},{"w":"this,","start":265.196},{"w":"but","start":265.436},{"w":"it's","start":265.676},{"w":"a","start":265.876},{"w":"reminder","start":265.996},{"w":"that","start":266.516},{"w":"a","start":266.636},{"w":"model","start":266.756},{"w":"can","start":267.196},{"w":"only","start":267.396},{"w":"be","start":267.676},{"w":"as","start":267.836},{"w":"fair","start":268.036},{"w":"as","start":268.316},{"w":"its","start":268.476},{"w":"data.","start":268.716}]}],"title":"AI blooper: word maths gone wrong","shortTitle":"AI blooper: word maths gone wrong","props":{"year":2016,"label":"WORD MATHS GONE WRONG","quoted":false,"token":"man : programmer :: woman : ?","explain":"Researchers found word vectors had learned stereotypes from the text they were trained on.","prompt":"man is to computer programmer as woman is to…","reply":"\"homemaker\"","replyAt":"c38@reply"},"start":237.867,"end":269.158,"startFrame":7136,"durationInFrames":966},{"id":"myth","kind":"myth","component":"MythVsReality","short":true,"cues":[{"id":"c39","start":270.067,"end":271.577,"marks":{},"text":"Myth versus reality.","words":[{"w":"Myth","start":270.36},{"w":"versus","start":270.654},{"w":"reality.","start":270.947}]},{"id":"c40","start":271.977,"end":277.585,"marks":{},"text":"The myth: each number in a word's vector means one thing, like \"is it wet?\" or \"is it an animal?\".","words":[{"w":"The","start":271.977},{"w":"myth:","start":272.137},{"w":"each","start":272.47},{"w":"number","start":272.804},{"w":"in","start":273.137},{"w":"a","start":273.297},{"w":"word's","start":273.564},{"w":"vector","start":273.83},{"w":"means","start":274.097},{"w":"one","start":274.377},{"w":"thing,","start":274.617},{"w":"like","start":274.857},{"w":"\"is","start":275.137},{"w":"it","start":275.377},{"w":"wet?\"","start":275.577},{"w":"or","start":276.137},{"w":"\"is","start":276.457},{"w":"it","start":276.697},{"w":"an","start":276.897},{"w":"animal?\".","start":277.097}]},{"id":"c41","start":277.985,"end":285.94,"marks":{"reality":278.145},"text":"The reality: meaning is spread across many numbers at once. A single number on its own rarely means anything you could put a name to.","words":[{"w":"The","start":277.985},{"w":"reality:","start":278.145},{"w":"meaning","start":278.945},{"w":"is","start":279.345},{"w":"spread","start":279.585},{"w":"across","start":279.905},{"w":"many","start":280.265},{"w":"numbers","start":280.625},{"w":"at","start":280.985},{"w":"once.","start":281.185},{"w":"A","start":281.705},{"w":"single","start":282.065},{"w":"number","start":282.425},{"w":"on","start":282.785},{"w":"its","start":282.985},{"w":"own","start":283.225},{"w":"rarely","start":283.585},{"w":"means","start":284.065},{"w":"anything","start":284.385},{"w":"you","start":284.745},{"w":"could","start":284.905},{"w":"put","start":285.065},{"w":"a","start":285.225},{"w":"name","start":285.385},{"w":"to.","start":285.665}]}],"title":"Myth vs reality: does each number mean something?","shortTitle":"Does each number in an AI's brain mean one thing?","props":{"myth":"Each number means one thing, like “is it wet?”","reality":"Meaning is spread across many numbers at once. A single number rarely means anything you could name.","revealAt":"c41@reality"},"start":270.067,"end":285.94,"startFrame":8102,"durationInFrames":504},{"id":"useIt","kind":"useIt","component":"UseIt","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c42","start":286.867,"end":291.451,"marks":{},"text":"And here's your \"Use it tomorrow\" tip: search your notes by meaning, not keywords.","words":[{"w":"And","start":286.867},{"w":"here's","start":286.947},{"w":"your","start":287.267},{"w":"\"Use","start":287.467},{"w":"it","start":287.747},{"w":"tomorrow\"","start":287.987},{"w":"tip:","start":288.387},{"w":"search","start":288.867},{"w":"your","start":289.267},{"w":"notes","start":289.427},{"w":"by","start":289.787},{"w":"meaning,","start":289.987},{"w":"not","start":290.475},{"w":"keywords.","start":290.963}]},{"id":"c43","start":291.851,"end":304.081,"marks":{},"text":"Many note and document apps now offer an AI or \"semantic\" search. When you use it, describe what you mean rather than guessing exact words, like \"that article about saving on electricity\".","words":[{"w":"Many","start":291.851},{"w":"note","start":292.171},{"w":"and","start":292.451},{"w":"document","start":292.611},{"w":"apps","start":293.071},{"w":"now","start":293.531},{"w":"offer","start":293.771},{"w":"an","start":294.131},{"w":"AI","start":294.551},{"w":"or","start":294.971},{"w":"\"semantic\"","start":295.491},{"w":"search.","start":296.291},{"w":"When","start":296.931},{"w":"you","start":297.211},{"w":"use","start":297.451},{"w":"it,","start":297.771},{"w":"describe","start":298.011},{"w":"what","start":298.651},{"w":"you","start":298.811},{"w":"mean","start":298.971},{"w":"rather","start":299.211},{"w":"than","start":299.531},{"w":"guessing","start":299.691},{"w":"exact","start":300.171},{"w":"words,","start":300.691},{"w":"like","start":301.251},{"w":"\"that","start":301.531},{"w":"article","start":301.771},{"w":"about","start":302.371},{"w":"saving","start":302.651},{"w":"on","start":303.091},{"w":"electricity\".","start":303.211}]}],"title":"Use it tomorrow","shortTitle":"Use it tomorrow","props":{"tip":"Search your notes by meaning, not keywords","bullets":["Look for “AI search” in your notes app","Describe what you mean, not exact words","Try: “that article about saving electricity”"],"bulletsAt":"c43"},"start":286.867,"end":304.081,"startFrame":8606,"durationInFrames":544},{"id":"recap","kind":"recapNext","component":"RecapNext","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c44","start":305,"end":312.485,"marks":{},"text":"Let's stamp the passport. Every token becomes a vector: a position on a map of meaning, where similar words sit close together.","words":[{"w":"Let's","start":305.12},{"w":"stamp","start":305.24},{"w":"the","start":305.64},{"w":"passport.","start":305.8},{"w":"Every","start":306.6},{"w":"token","start":306.96},{"w":"becomes","start":307.44},{"w":"a","start":307.62},{"w":"vector:","start":307.8},{"w":"a","start":308.52},{"w":"position","start":308.76},{"w":"on","start":309.24},{"w":"a","start":309.4},{"w":"map","start":309.48},{"w":"of","start":309.72},{"w":"meaning,","start":309.88},{"w":"where","start":310.32},{"w":"similar","start":310.52},{"w":"words","start":311.08},{"w":"sit","start":311.4},{"w":"close","start":311.68},{"w":"together.","start":312}]},{"id":"c45","start":312.885,"end":319.043,"marks":{},"text":"The map learns itself from text, directions carry meaning, and position numbers keep track of word order.","words":[{"w":"The","start":312.885},{"w":"map","start":313.005},{"w":"learns","start":313.285},{"w":"itself","start":313.645},{"w":"from","start":314.045},{"w":"text,","start":314.245},{"w":"directions","start":314.805},{"w":"carry","start":315.525},{"w":"meaning,","start":315.885},{"w":"and","start":316.405},{"w":"position","start":316.805},{"w":"numbers","start":317.205},{"w":"keep","start":317.605},{"w":"track","start":317.885},{"w":"of","start":318.205},{"w":"word","start":318.365},{"w":"order.","start":318.645}]},{"id":"c46","start":319.443,"end":328.286,"marks":{"question":322.123},"text":"But each word still has its meaning on its own. In \"the bank of the river\", how does the model know which bank you mean? Next stop: Attention Junction.","words":[{"w":"But","start":319.443},{"w":"each","start":319.603},{"w":"word","start":319.883},{"w":"still","start":320.163},{"w":"has","start":320.443},{"w":"its","start":320.643},{"w":"meaning","start":320.883},{"w":"on","start":321.203},{"w":"its","start":321.363},{"w":"own.","start":321.643},{"w":"In","start":322.123},{"w":"\"the","start":322.363},{"w":"bank","start":322.643},{"w":"of","start":323.003},{"w":"the","start":323.123},{"w":"river\",","start":323.283},{"w":"how","start":323.603},{"w":"does","start":323.843},{"w":"the","start":324.043},{"w":"model","start":324.203},{"w":"know","start":324.643},{"w":"which","start":324.803},{"w":"bank","start":325.003},{"w":"you","start":325.363},{"w":"mean?","start":325.563},{"w":"Next","start":325.963},{"w":"stop:","start":326.403},{"w":"Attention","start":326.963},{"w":"Junction.","start":327.683}]}],"title":"Recap and next stop","shortTitle":"Recap and next stop","props":{"nextStop":"Attention Junction","nextQuestion":"How does it understand the whole sentence, not just single words?","questionAt":"c46@question"},"start":305,"end":328.286,"startFrame":9150,"durationInFrames":744}],"refs":{"c01":0.6,"c01@stamp":2.92,"c02":3.888,"c03":12.833,"c04":19.02,"c05":24.067,"c05@here":27.267,"c06":31.867,"c07":36.828,"c08":41.237,"c09":49.745,"c10":56.799,"c11":64.7,"c12":73.259,"c13":77.497,"c14":81.037,"c15":84.773,"c16":89.442,"c17":94.267,"c18":105.968,"c19":109.639,"c20":118.7,"c21":122.854,"c22":129.406,"c23":135.61,"c24":141.467,"c25":148.057,"c26":152.324,"c27":161.733,"c28":174.797,"c29":181.999,"c30":188.067,"c31":191.558,"c32":198.744,"c33":209.967,"c34":213.155,"c35":219.19,"c36":237.867,"c37":241.646,"c38":252.076,"c38@reply":253.696,"c39":270.067,"c40":271.977,"c41":277.985,"c41@reality":27